#showas:起义
A very difficult scenario. Still mainly you and the AI, and it's set to difficulty 8.
This difficulty is good for someone who is skilled at AI War 2.

This is on the "realistic" map type, with 90 planets. Royal AI type, which has extremely powerful Guardians, and it also has far more than normal.
Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

Human Resistance Fighters are allies that will occasionally appear in a battle to help you for free, then leave after.

There are also Friendly Marauders, human pirates that will also occasionally appear and attack your enemies with the goal of capturing the planet to use as a base to strengthen themselves, as well as fortifying your planets.